# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: The Perenolde Tiara (543); Plea to the Alliance (634) handed in at Refuge Pointe; MacKreel's Moonshine (647),
# moved from 01-hillsbrad-foothills for its 15-minute limit: taken after Kor'gresh, handed in straight off the Refuge Pointe flight (#1319).
# My Little Friends (93176) is optional (#1314): nobody has been recorded taking it, and Amaryllis Webb was never seen.
# Since the 0.3.7 audit: Refuge Pointe's hand-ins come on the walk from Go'Shek Farm to the Stone of West Binding, and the
# Swamp of Sorrows ends Harborage, then Watcher Biggs, on the road out.
# Left out: A Meal Served Cold (212): its 30-minute limit can't last from Stormwind to the Cold Eye Basilisks in Stranglethorn and back.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Swamp of Sorrows

step Fly to Darkshire
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  goto 27.5,77.7 "Booty Bay flight master"
  fly "Darkshire"
  zone Duskwood

step Swamp of Sorrows
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  goto 26.7,59.8 "Watcher Biggs"

step Watcher Biggs
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Watcher Biggs guards the road junction in the west of the swamp. Amaryllis Webb stands a short way north of him.
  tip Amaryllis Webb may not be here on Forever: if Amaryllis Webb doesn't offer My Little Friends, skip it.
  accept 1396                         -- Watcher Biggs
  accept 93176 optional               -- Amaryllis Webb: three critters to catch in Arathi, Desolace and Stranglethorn

step The western swamp
  tip Young crocolisks, Sorrow Spinners and Swamp Jaguars all roam the swamp around the road.
  kill 1084 quest 1396.1              -- Young Sawtooth Crocolisk
  kill 858 quest 1396.2               -- Sorrow Spinner
  kill 767 quest 1396.3               -- Swamp Jaguar

step Watcher Biggs
  turnin 1396
  accept 1421

step The Harborage
  tip Follow the road north to the draenei of the Harborage.
  accept 1389                         -- Magtoor

step Fallow Sanctuary
  tip East along the road to the Fallow Sanctuary. The Lost One mobs drop the crystals; Noboru walks the ruins and drops his cudgel.
  collect 6196 "Noboru's Cudgel"
  accept 1392
  collect 6071 quest 1389             -- Draenethyst Crystal

step The Lost Caravan
  tip The wrecked caravan's chest lies at the north end of the Fallow Sanctuary, beside Galen Goodward's cage.
  tip Careful: The camp is full of Lost Ones around level 38. They stand in linked groups of 2-3, many are casters, and they respawn quickly.
  collect 6170 quest 1421             -- Wizards' Reagents

step Galen Goodward
  tip Galen is caged at the north end of the sanctuary. Free him and keep him alive on the walk out; his strongbox waits by the road afterwards.
  accept 1393
  complete 1393
  turnin 1393                         -- Galen's Strongbox

step The Harborage
  tip West along the road from Galen's strongbox to the Harborage.
  turnin 1392                         -- Magtoor: Noboru's cudgel
  turnin 1389

step Watcher Biggs
  tip South down the road to Watcher Biggs, on the way west out of the swamp.
  turnin 1421

step Duskwood
  zone Duskwood
  goto 77.6,44.4 "Darkshire"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stormwind

step Fly to Stormwind
  tip Back west through Deadwind Pass to Darkshire.
  zone Duskwood
  fly "Stormwind"                     -- Felicia Maline, Darkshire

step Stormwind
  zone Stormwind City
  accept 1260                         -- Angus Stern, Stormwind Harbor road

step The Binding
  only Warlock
  tip Gakin the Darkbinder waits in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar, in the Mage Quarter. Use the Heartswood Core at the summoning circle there and defeat the succubus it calls. If you took What Is Love?, hand him the Wooden Figurine too, place it at the same circle and defeat the incubus.
  turnin 1738                         -- Gakin the Darkbinder
  accept 1739
  kill 5677 quest 1739.1 @39.2,84.4 live -- Summoned Succubus, at the summoning circle
  turnin 1739                         -- Summon Succubus
  turnin 65602 optional               -- What Is Love?, if you took it
  accept 65603 optional
  kill 185335 quest 65603.1 optional  -- Summoned Incubus, at the same circle
  turnin 65603 optional               -- Gakin binds the incubus to you

step Stormwind
  zone Stormwind City
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid
  accept 6141                         -- Brother Crowley, Cathedral of Light

