# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Refuge Pointe

step Refuge Pointe
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Follow the road east out of Hillsbrad over Thoradin's Wall to Refuge Pointe.
  getfp "Refuge Pointe"
  turnin 634                          -- Captain Nials: Rhag Garmason's plea, from 01-hillsbrad-foothills
  accept 681
  turnin 690                          -- Skuerto
  accept 691                          -- Apprentice Kryten

step Northfold Manor
  tip The Syndicate hold the farm north-west of Refuge Pointe.
  tip Careful: Syndicate Highwaymen are level 30-31 and can cast Sneak while out of combat, so they are often stealthed and hard to spot.
  kill 2586 quest 681.1               -- Syndicate Highwayman
  kill 2589 quest 681.2               -- Syndicate Mercenary

step Hay Weevil
  when onquest 93176
  tip Hay Weevils crawl about the north end of Northfold Manor's farm: catch one with the tool from Amaryllis Webb's Entomology Starter Kit.
  collect 213568 "Hay Weevil Specimen" @31.3,27.2

step Witherbark Village
  tip A few Witherbark trolls camp south of Northfold, on the way; the main village lies in the hills south of Go'Shek Farm in the south-east, where the Witch Doctors stand and the Shadow Hunters guard the far end of the valley. Every troll can drop a tusk.
  collect 4503 quest 691.1            -- Witherbark Tusk
  collect 4522 quest 691.2            -- Witherbark Medicine Pouch
  collect 5040 quest 691.3            -- Shadow Hunter Knife; below ground

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Myzrael story

step Shards of Myzrael
  tip Head north past Go'Shek Farm; the shards glitter on the hill by the Circle of East Binding.
  turnin 635 optional                 -- Only if Gluggle gave you the pendant in Stranglethorn
  accept 642

step Drywhisker Gorge: kill these as you meet them
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The Drywhisker kobolds dig in the gorge east of Hammerfall (Horde); skirt the town to the north. They drop both the motes and Krazek's ore.
  tip Careful: Every kobold type runs off for help when low on health (Kobolds at 30%, Surveyors and Diggers at 15%), which can pull more of them.
  collect 4278 quest 627              -- Lesser Bloodstone Ore
  collect 4435 quest 642                      -- Mote of Myzrael from Drywhisker Kobold, Drywhisker Surveyor and Drywhisker Digger, by this stop

step Iridescent Shards
  tip The shards lie at the far end of Drywhisker Gorge.
  turnin 642                          -- Below ground
  accept 651

step Stones of Binding
  tip Each key lies at one of the Highlands' standing-stone circles: east of the shards, near Refuge Pointe and in the west. The Stone of Inner Binding stands west of Refuge Pointe.
  tip Careful: Each center stone is guarded by around three elementals near level 39 that attack together if you click the stone without clearing them: Burning Exiles at West, Thundering Exiles at Outer, Cresting Exiles at East.
  collect 4484 quest 651.2            -- Cresting Key: Stone of East Binding

