step Kinelory's errand
  tip Stay with Kinelory while she sneaks into Go'Shek Farm and back; Horde orcs jump you on the way.
  tip Careful: Orcs that drop to low health run away. Kinelory follows them and can pull more mobs, so kill or slow runners fast.
  goto 60.1,53.8
  complete 660

