# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Faldir's Cove

step Faldir's Cove
  tip South along the west coast to the goblins' cove; Lolo keeps watch on the rocks above it.
  accept 663                          -- Lolo the Lookout
  turnin 663                          -- Shakes O'Breen
  accept 662                          -- First Mate Nilzlix
  accept 664                          -- Captain Steelgut
  accept 665                          -- Professor Phizzlethorpe

step Phizzlethorpe
  tip Escort the professor up the hill to the cave above the cove and guard him while he works. Two level 40 water elementals ambush him there, and they are immune to frost. Hold them at the cave mouth, away from him: if the fight happens inside the cave, he joins in instead of working and more elementals keep coming.
  goto 33.9,80.6
  complete 665

step Doctor Draxlegauge
  turnin 665
  accept 666

step The Drowned Reef: kill these as you meet them
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The two wrecks lie in the bay west of the cove. The charts and logs are inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around them. Daggerspine naga swim the whole bay.
  kill 2595 quest 664.1               -- Daggerspine Raider, underwater
  collect 4492 quest 666              -- Elven Gem; underwater
  kill 2596 quest 664.2               -- Daggerspine Sorceress, underwater
  collect 4489 quest 662.2            -- Maiden's Folly Log; underwater
  collect 4487 quest 662.1            -- Maiden's Folly Charts; underwater
  collect 4490 quest 662.4            -- Spirit of Silverpine Log; underwater
  collect 4488 quest 662.3            -- Spirit of Silverpine Charts; underwater

