step Kor'gresh Coldrage
  tip East from Faldir's Cove through the southern hills: Kor'gresh, an ogre mage, holds the cave at the southern end of the Witherbark valley.
  collect 4525 quest 693              -- Trelane's Wand of Invocation; below ground

step Foggy MacKreel
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip South-west from Kor'gresh's cave to the Thandol Span: Foggy MacKreel stands on a broken section of the bridge; jump down to him from its north end. MacKreel's Moonshine must reach Brewmeister Bilger in Southshore within 15 minutes: go straight back to Refuge Pointe and fly to Southshore.
  accept 647 only Dwarf,Gnome,NightElf,Skyborne

