# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Alterac Mountains

step Gavin's Naze
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Follow the road north out of Southshore into the mountains. Mountain lions roam the slopes; the Syndicate in Strahnbrad wear the signet rings, and Baron Vardus walks the manor grounds on the north side of town.
  kill 2407 quest 564.2 @44.2,76.7 map 1416 -- Hulking Mountain Lion
  kill 2406 quest 564.1 @32.1,82.8 map 1416 -- Mountain Lion

step Ruins of Alterac: kill these as you meet them
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip The tomes lie in the ruined keep west of Strahnbrad; Argus Shadow Mages hold the ruins.
  tip Careful: Crushridge Warmongers call nearby allies within 15 yd once they fall below half health.
  tip The Crushridge Maulers, Mages, Enforcers and Warmongers (36-39) are elite; the Crushridge Ogres and Brutes (34-35) are not and carry the tomes too: pull one at a time, or group up.
  collect 3658 quest 540.1            -- Recovered Tome: Crushridge ogres
  collect 3659 quest 540.2            -- Worn Leather Book: the Weathered Bookcase; inside

step Ruins of Alterac: kill these as you meet them
  when group 543
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Grel'borg the Miser is a level 40 elite: most classes solo it at level 42, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 3684 quest 543.1 @35.6,54.4 map 1416

step Strahnbrad: kill these as you meet them
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Careful: Syndicate Spies and Assassins can be stealthed. Assassins also poison you.
  tip Careful: About three stealthed Syndicate mobs are inside Nagaz's house. Nagaz does not join when they are pulled, and a ranged attack through the doorway brings him out by himself.
  collect 3505 quest 512              -- Alterac Signet Ring
  kill 2318 quest 537.1               -- Argus Shadow Mage
  collect 3626 quest 523              -- Head of Baron Vardus

step Crushridge ogres
  tip The Crushridge ogres hold the hills north of Strahnbrad. Farther north, a worn wooden chest holds the Ensorcelled Parchment; Nagaz of the Dark Council stands right by it.
  tip The Crushridge Maulers, Mages, Enforcers and Warmongers (36-39) are elite; the Crushridge Ogres and Brutes (34-35) are not and drop the knucklebones too: pull one at a time, or group up.
  collect 2843 quest 500              -- Dirty Knucklebones
  collect 3706 "Ensorcelled Parchment" -- Inside
  accept 551
  collect 3672 quest 537.2            -- Head of Nagaz

